Box 52934 (fictional seats), a wrong number reached the asker: the helper
saw [„დათო გამოგონილი (საბურთალოს სანტექნიკი)", „დათო გამოგონილი (მეორე
ჩანაწერი)", „სხვა, მე დავწერ"] — written by the model, in its own order —
typed „მეორე", and the server sent the name search's second row, which was
the Saburtalo plumber on the FIRST button.

- The name search now keeps, per namesake, what it showed about them.
- An ordinal is read against the buttons on screen: a button is matched to
  the one namesake its own words point to (stems, so case endings match),
  or by elimination when exactly one button and one person are left over.
- When the buttons do not settle it, the phone the run chose stands (the
  model wrote those buttons). The search order is never used again.

No new words; the refusal set is unchanged.

